#: src/ui/charging.rs:159 src/ui/charging.rs:252
msgid "Charge Limit"
msgstr "Limite de charge"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:16
msgid "Run on Battery"
msgstr "Fonctionner sur batterie"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:161
msgid ""
"Lithium batteries wear faster when kept at full charge. If your laptop is "
"plugged in most of the time, limiting the charge to about 80% can noticeably "
"extend the battery's lifespan."
msgstr ""
"Les batteries au lithium s’usent plus vite lorsqu’elles restent pleines. Si "
"votre ordinateur est branché la plupart du temps, limiter la charge à "
"environ 80% peut prolonger sensiblement la durée de vie de la batterie."

#: src/ui/charging.rs:164
msgid "Current Setting"
msgstr "Réglage actuel"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:168
msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Profil"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:174
msgid "Limit Maximum Charge"
msgstr "Limiter la charge maximale"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:176
msgid "Stop Charging At"
msgstr "Arrêter la charge à"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:177 src/ui/power.rs:197 src/ui/preferences.rs:53
msgid "Percent"
msgstr "Pourcentage"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:181
msgid "Resume Charging Below"
msgstr "Reprendre la charge sous"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:182
msgid "Avoids topping up after every small drop"
msgstr "Évite de recharger après chaque petite baisse"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:186
msgid "Keep After Restart"
msgstr "Conserver après un redémarrage"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:187
msgid "Re-apply the limit at startup and after waking from sleep"
msgstr "Réapplique la limite au démarrage et à la sortie de veille"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:191
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Appliquer"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:207
msgid "Charging Schedule"
msgstr "Programmation de la charge"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:208
msgid ""
"Charge to 100% just before you need the laptop, and keep your limit the rest "
"of the time. This needs a saved charge limit: turn on Limit Maximum Charge "
"and Keep After Restart, then Apply."
msgstr ""
"Chargez à 100% juste avant d’avoir besoin de l’ordinateur, et gardez votre "
"limite le reste du temps. Cela nécessite une limite de charge enregistrée : "
"activez « Limiter la charge maximale » et « Conserver après un "
"redémarrage », puis appuyez sur Appliquer."

#: src/ui/charging.rs:211
msgid "Optimized Charging"
msgstr "Charge optimisée"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:212
msgid "Learns when you usually unplug and charges to 100% just before"
msgstr "Apprend quand vous débranchez d’habitude et charge à 100% juste avant"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:214
msgid "Learned So Far"
msgstr "Appris jusqu’ici"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:217
msgid "Start Charging Before"
msgstr "Commencer la charge avant"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:218
msgid "Hours before the time, to have it full by then"
msgstr "Heures avant l’heure choisie, pour qu’elle soit pleine à ce moment-là"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:222
msgid "Add a Time…"
msgstr "Ajouter une heure…"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:225
msgid "Save Schedule"
msgstr "Enregistrer la programmation"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:239
msgid "One-Off Charging Plans"
msgstr "Plans de charge ponctuels"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:240
msgid ""
"Use a local date and time for a single full charge, or skip one upcoming "
"charge. Recurring rules stay saved."
msgstr "Choisissez une date et une heure locales pour une seule charge complète, ou ignorez la prochaine charge. Les règles récurrentes sont conservées."

#: src/ui/charging.rs:242
msgid "Ready By Once"
msgstr "Prête une fois pour"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:243
msgid "Plan a Full Charge…"
msgstr "Planifier une charge complète…"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:244
msgid "Cancel Plan"
msgstr "Annuler le plan"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:246
msgid "Skip One Charge"
msgstr "Ignorer une charge"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:247 src/ui/charging.rs:801
msgid "Skip Next Charge"
msgstr "Ignorer la prochaine charge"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:254
msgid "Not supported on this laptop"
msgstr "Non pris en charge sur cet ordinateur"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:255
msgid ""
"The battery driver does not expose charge thresholds "
"(charge_control_end_threshold)."
msgstr ""
"Le pilote de la batterie n’expose pas de seuils de charge "
"(charge_control_end_threshold)."

#: src/ui/charging.rs:263 src/ui/charging.rs:743
msgid "Charge to 100% Now"
msgstr "Charger à 100% maintenant"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:265 src/ui/charging.rs:749
msgid "Charge Now"
msgstr "Charger maintenant"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:272
msgid "Charging Behavior"
msgstr "Comportement de charge"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:273
msgid ""
"Temporarily pause charging, or run from the battery while still plugged in."
msgstr ""
"Suspendez temporairement la charge, ou fonctionnez sur la batterie tout en "
"restant branché."

#: src/ui/charging.rs:276
msgid "While Plugged In"
msgstr "Lorsque l’ordinateur est branché"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:29
